Strict container compilation rejected test_codec.cpp bad.back() mutation with -Werror=stringop-overflow. Replace with bounds-checked at(packet.size()-1), preserving the negative test.
Collector strict compilation caught misleading indentation in choices initialization and stale decode_ec93 symbol. Braced initialization loop and corrected decode_ec94.
Native initial adversarial run identified an invalid negative-test assumption: flipping a valid rANS initial state may encode a different valid coefficient sequence with valid terminal states. Removed arbitrary state-bit rejection; retain zero/out-of-range initial state and explicit terminal-state tests.
